Would you say that 2007 cannot be returned? But after many years, 2007 is coming back to us!
Welcome Back To 2007, is an old-school platformer game.

Features:
■ 2023 beautiful achievements;
■ Original soundtrack by Anacom & Golod;
■ 31 different levels;
■ Cool plot and dialogues;
■ Jetpack working on a real physical model;
■ The final boss fight;
■ 3 Difficulty, leaderboards, controller support;
■ New features are already available!

You play as Emo Boy, who bridge over the difficulties to achieve his sacred wishes. Evil grandmas, chavs, security guards, goths, weeaboos and haters appear on his way. But our EmoBoy will never surrender! With help of tears, literally, he smashes his way: plunge your enemies into shock by shooting them with your tears. You need to collect cigarettes in order to replenish your Jetpack stock! Your main companion and mentor is Girl with Guitar. She will not let you get bored and always will help you with advice on any trouble!

Man in gravity - a runner in which the player is able to control the force of gravity (change the gravity up and down). The goal of the player is to run as far as possible, and preferably get a better result than other players (the game has a leaderboard). The visual design of the game was designed in minimalism. The entire game world is generated from pre-prepared sections of tunnels. In this game, the key role is played not only by the skill of dexterity of the player, but also his luck.

Press space bar to change the gravity!

Key features:
- Procedural generation;
- Minimalism;
- 6 easy achievements;
- Nice soundtrack.

"The 8th Avenue" is a single-player exploration adventure game that combines anomalies, thrillers, and horror.

Players drive cars on the road, and there is a certain probability of encountering anomalies each time. If the player determines that there is an anomaly on the current street, he can choose to turn around. If there is no anomaly, he will continue to drive forward. If the judgment is correct, he will enter the next street. If the judgment fails, he will return to the initial street and fall into an infinite loop. Players need to leave this place from Eighth Avenue through their own efforts.

Game Features:

• Experience a variety of anomalies (obvious, hidden, interactive, thrilling, etc.);

• Simple driving operation, tricky first-person perspective, exciting game experience;

• Seemingly irrelevant anomalies, but actually hidden mysteries;

• The more anomalies you explore, the clearer the ending;

The existence of all mankind is under threat, it turned out to be on the verge of extinction due to the black hole that arose out of nowhere, which will soon swallow our Sun.

The only possible solution is to search for earth-like and inhabited worlds, to send ships there, in the hope that they would survive and the human race would continue to exist.

Your task is to search for such planets with the help of a space telescope and give humanity another chance!

Features:

- random star systems and planets;
- resource management;
- elements of (simplified) scientific analysis;
- instructions in english, russian, uzbek.

